{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-final-summary.md","title":"Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy","display":"df-final-summary — Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-final-summary","aliases":["92-df-final-summary"],"display":"df-final-summary — Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy","depends_on":["[[92-df-final-count]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-final-summary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-final-summary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-final-summary — Nine-Part Atom Taxonomy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d115b577d99026dc\" href=\"?note=d115b577d99026dc\" title=\"92-df-final-count\">92-df-final-count</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\)</span> (atom-document set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d115b577d99026dc\" href=\"?note=d115b577d99026dc\" title=\"92-df-final-count\">92-df-final-count</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_1,\\ldots,C_9\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92})^9\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_1,\\ldots,C_9\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92})^9\\)</span> (category family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\">\\(\\kappa:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\\)</span> (category-assignment map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}\\)</span> (definition-target taxonomy predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}final\\text{-}summary} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}^{\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}}\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\\;\\bigl(C_i=\\{a\\in\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\mid\\kappa(a)=i\\}\\land C_i\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}final\\text{-}summary} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Summary}_{92}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\kappa\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}^{\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}}\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,9\\}\\;\\bigl(C_i=\\{a\\in\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\mid\\kappa(a)=i\\}\\land C_i\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Core-Categories\">[Core Categories]</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1.-Basic-Formal-Systems\">1. Basic Formal Systems</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Formal system, formula, term, sentence, proof, axiom</li>\n<li>Logical system, connectives, quantifiers</li>\n<li>Language of arithmetic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_A\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_A\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2.-Gödel-Encoding\">2. Gödel Encoding</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel numbering, arithmetization</li>\n<li>Proof predicate, provability predicate</li>\n<li>Substitution function, diagonal function, proof-code operations</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3.-Recursion-Theory\">3. Recursion Theory</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>PR functions, recursive functions</li>\n<li>Composition, recursion, minimization</li>\n<li>CE sets, decidable sets, halting set</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4.-Self-Reference\">4. Self-Reference</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel sentence, Rosser sentence</li>\n<li>Löb sentence, Henkin sentence</li>\n<li>Syntactic fixed-point (diagonal) lemma</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5.-Incompleteness-Theorems\">5. Incompleteness Theorems</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>First incompleteness, second incompleteness</li>\n<li>Rosser improvement, Löb theorem</li>\n<li>Consistency strength hierarchy</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6.-Arithmetic-Hierarchy\">6. Arithmetic Hierarchy</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\)</span> formulas</li>\n<li>Post theorem, hierarchy properties</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> completeness, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> incompleteness</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7.-Provability-Logic\">7. Provability Logic</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>GL system, axioms K/4/L</li>\n<li>Arithmetic realization</li>\n<li>Solovay completeness</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8.-Model-Theory\">8. Model Theory</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>, nonstandard models</li>\n<li>True arithmetic TA</li>\n<li>Compactness, completeness theorem</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9.-Advanced-Topics\">9. Advanced Topics</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Creative sets, productive sets, simple sets</li>\n<li>Many-one reducibility, m-complete sets</li>\n<li>Proof-theoretic ordinals, Gentzen consistency proof</li>\n<li>Normal ordinal functions and their ordinal fixed points</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Book-Information\">[Book Information]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6\" href=\"?note=cd8dcab3ce41cbc6\" title=\"92-book-info\">92-book-info</a> — Complete book info</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"baf256d78d60c2a6\" href=\"?note=baf256d78d60c2a6\" title=\"92-MOC\">92-MOC</a> — Master overview concept map</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Core-Categories","text":"[Core Categories]","level":2},{"id":"1.-Basic-Formal-Systems","text":"1. Basic Formal Systems","level":3},{"id":"2